[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF8C00]⚡ What is TNHoppers?[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
Are traditional vanilla hoppers dragging your server's [B]TPS[/B] down and inflating [B]MSPT[/B]? Do massive mob farms, cactus grinders, and sorting systems with thousands of hoppers freeze your server?

[B]TNHoppers[/B] is a groundbreaking, production-hardened [B]Wireless Hopper & Suction System[/B] crafted by [B]Tài Nguyễn (TN)[/B]. It completely replaces long, laggy vanilla hopper chains with high-speed, direct wireless routing, an event-driven suction engine, and an atomic transaction architecture that guarantees 100% item conservation.

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]🔥 Standout Features[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B][COLOR=#FFD700]🌪️ 2 Specialized Hopper Types:[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]Normal Hopper (Radius Mode):[/B] Collects dropped items within a configurable spherical radius (upgradable from [B]5 to 24 blocks[/B] with in-GUI [B]Radius Selector (Slot 21)[/B] and [B]Player Drop Protection[/B]).
[*][B]Chunk Hopper (Chunk Vacuum):[/B] Instantly vacuums [B]ALL[/B] ground items across the entire 16×16 chunk from bedrock to sky limit! Calls entity detection only once per cycle per chunk, keeping TPS at a locked 20.0.
[/LIST]

[*][B][COLOR=#FFD700]🪄 Wireless Linking with Link Wand:[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*]Link hoppers to chests, barrels, and shulkers wirelessly using [B]/tnhoppers wand[/B].
[*]Double chest normalization automatically binds to the canonical master chest.
[*][B]Two Transfer Modes:[/B] Sequential priority ([B]INSERT_BY_ORDER[/B]) or round-robin ([B]DISTRIBUTE_EQUALLY[/B]).
[/LIST]

[*][B][COLOR=#FFD700]🧙‍♂️ Brand New in v0.6.2: Auto-Sorter Wizard (Slot 48):[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*]Automatically set up complex chest sorting in seconds!
[*]Place item samples in your inventory/hotbar and click Slot 48:
[*]Left-click to assign [B]Whitelist[/B], Right-click to assign [B]Blacklist[/B].
[*]Chests are [B]automatically renamed[/B] to friendly item titles (e.g. [I]Raw Iron, Lapis Lazuli, Diamond[/I])!
[*]Non-mutating read-only sampling, 10-second overwrite protection, and transactional database rollback.
[/LIST]

[*][B][COLOR=#FFD700]🏷️ Custom Chest Renaming (Slot 47):[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*]Name your linked chests directly in chat or Shift-Click to distinguish between Ore, Farm, and Drop chests.
[/LIST]

[*][B][COLOR=#FFD700]📦 Visual Per-Link GUI Filtering (54-Slot Chest):[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*]Set Whitelist or Blacklist filters per linked container.
[*]Strict ItemMeta matching accurately handles custom names, lore, enchantments, and potions.
[*]One-click Copy & Paste clipboard to duplicate filters across chests.
[*]Auto-Void Unmatched option destroys unwanted trash items automatically.
[/LIST]

[*][B][COLOR=#FFD700]💎 Interactive 5-Branch Upgrades GUI:[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*]Upgrade [B]Speed[/B] (down to 2 ticks), [B]Amount[/B] (up to 64 items), [B]Max Links[/B] (up to 15 chests), [B]Distance/Radius[/B] (up to 250 blocks / 24 blocks), and [B]Virtual Deep Storage[/B] (up to 250,000 items)!
[*]Supports [B]Vault Economy[/B] with automatic [B]XP Levels[/B] fallback.
[/LIST]

[*][B][COLOR=#FFD700]🌌 Virtual Deep Storage Buffer (10,000 → 250,000 Items):[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*]Linked containers never drop or lose items when physical storage is full!
[*]Upgradable capacities: [B]10k → 50k → 100k → 250k items[/B].
[*]Auto-drains stored items back into chest slots whenever space opens up.
[*]Interactive Deep Storage viewer GUI to inspect contents and withdraw stacks on demand.
[*]Anti-loss protection: unlinking a container is strictly blocked until its virtual buffer is emptied.
[/LIST]

[*][B][COLOR=#FFD700]🛡️ Active Break & Explosion Protection:[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*]Prevents accidental player breaking of linked hoppers and linked destination containers (single/double chests, barrels, shulkers).
[*]Blocks break events with an audio chime and warning message — must unlink in GUI first!
[*]Immunity to TNT, Creeper, and Wither explosion damage for all linked network blocks.
[*]SuperiorSkyblock2 island permission validation (BUILD & CHEST) with cross-island isolation.
[/LIST]

[*][B][COLOR=#FFD700]🚀 Zero-Lag Engine & PDC Preservation:[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*]When unlinked and broken, hoppers drop as items with all levels and types saved in [B]PDC metadata[/B].
[*]Zero-allocation live view cache ([B]activeHoppersView()[/B]) prevents GC pauses.
[*]Symmetrical transactional rollback restores both container and world entity if events fail.
[*]SQLite WAL single-writer architecture with PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE).
[*]Backed by [B]27 Automated Surefire Unit Tests (0 failures)[/B].
[/LIST]
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#32CD32]💻 Commands & Permissions[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH][COLOR=#FF8C00]Command[/COLOR][/TH]
[TH][COLOR=#FF8C00]Permission[/COLOR][/TH]
[TH][COLOR=#FF8C00]Default[/COLOR][/TH]
[TH][COLOR=#FF8C00]Description[/COLOR][/TH]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/tnhoppers[/TD]
[TD]tnhoppers.use[/TD]
[TD]Everyone (true)[/TD]
[TD]Opens Interactive Control Panel GUI[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/tnhoppers get <normal|chunk>[/TD]
[TD]tnhoppers.admin[/TD]
[TD]OP[/TD]
[TD]Gives a PDC-preserved TNHoppers item[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/tnhoppers wand[/TD]
[TD]tnhoppers.admin[/TD]
[TD]OP[/TD]
[TD]Gives a 60-second Link Wand[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/tnhoppers reload[/TD]
[TD]tnhoppers.admin[/TD]
[TD]OP[/TD]
[TD]Hot-reloads config.yml[/TD]
[/TR]
[/TABLE]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF8C00]⚙️ Configuration (config.yml)[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[SPOILER="Click to view default config.yml"]
[CODE=yaml]
storage:
  sqlite-file: "tnhoppers.db"
  busy-timeout-ms: 5000
  journal-mode: "WAL"
  synchronous: "NORMAL"

wireless:
  enabled: true
  default-max-links: 1
  default-max-distance: 15
  default-mode: "INSERT_BY_ORDER"

transfer:
  check-interval-ticks: 2
  interval-ticks: 20
  max-items-per-cycle: 1
  max-hoppers-per-cycle: 512

suction:
  enabled: true
  mode: "RADIUS"
  radius: 3.0
  interval-ticks: 10
  max-hoppers-per-cycle: 128
  max-entities-per-cycle: 128
  max-items-per-cycle: 64
  respect-item-owner: true

upgrades:
  purchases-enabled: true
  costs:
    speed-base: 1000.0
    amount-base: 2500.0
    links-base: 1500.0
    distance-base: 2000.0
    storage-base: 5000.0

integrations:
  superior-skyblock2:
    enabled: true
    require-island-to-place: true
    allow-cross-island-linking: false
    validate-island-membership-on-transfer: true
  vault:
    enabled: true
[/CODE]
[/SPOILER]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFD700]📋 Dependencies & Requirements[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[B][COLOR=#FF4500]⚡ Required:[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]Java 21+ JRE:[/B] [URL='https://adoptium.net/temurin/releases/?version=21'][COLOR=#00BFFF]Eclipse Temurin Java 21[/COLOR][/URL]
[I]Note for Minecraft 1.20:[/I] TNHoppers is compiled using Java 21 LTS bytecode. Even if running Paper 1.20.0-1.20.4, your server startup command must use Java 21+.
[*][B]Server Platform:[/B] [URL='https://papermc.io/downloads/paper'][COLOR=#00BFFF]Paper[/COLOR][/URL], [URL='https://purpurmc.org/'][COLOR=#00BFFF]Purpur[/COLOR][/URL], or Folia 1.20 - 1.21.x.
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#32CD32]🔌 Optional Integrations (Soft Dependencies):[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]Vault (Economy):[/B] [URL='https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/vault.34315/'][COLOR=#00BFFF]SpigotMC Link[/COLOR][/URL] - For economy upgrades (falls back to XP levels if not installed).
[*][B]SuperiorSkyblock2 (Island Protection):[/B] [URL='https://bg-software.com/superiorskyblock/'][COLOR=#00BFFF]Official Website[/COLOR][/URL] - For island boundary and permission enforcement (runs in standalone mode if absent).
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]🔨 Quick Installation[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST=1]
[*]Ensure your server starts on [B]Java 21[/B] and [B]Paper 1.20 - 1.21.x[/B].
[*]Download [B]TNHoppers-0.6.2.jar[/B].
[*]Place the .jar into your server's [B]plugins/[/B] folder.
[*][I](Optional)[/I] Install [B]Vault[/B] and [B]SuperiorSkyblock2[/B].
[*]Restart your server. You're ready to go!
[/LIST]

